{"synopsis":"Han Sung, seorang hunter monster SSS-Class dari Bumi, dipanggil ke dunia lain dan dipaksa mengabdikan seluruh hidupnya sebagai anjing pemburu Kekaisaran.\n\nNamun setelah dikhianati dan kehilangan nyawanya, ia terlahir kembali sebagai Dale, putra tertua dari keluarga Sachsen, sekaligus pewaris ‘Lord Black’, penyihir kegelapan terkuat di benua yang berkuasa di puncak Black Tower.\n\n“Aku sendiri yang akan menghancurkan Kekaisaran ini.”\n\nDengan menguasai pedang, sihir, dan necromancy, Dale bangkit sebagai jenius sejati, memanfaatkan seluruh pengetahuan dan kemampuan dari kehidupan sebelumnya.\n\nSampai di mana batas dari bakatnya?\nPerjalanan tanpa henti Dale dimulai sekarang!","alternative_title":"공작가의 역대급 신동","author":"Menyusul","artist":"Menyusul","chapters":[{"number":"49","chapter":"49","slug":"095cd7e9-72eb-4ed8-9c30-26d0bd26151a","title":"Chapter 49","date":"2026-05-24"},{"number":"48","chapter":"48","slug":"5fcffa96-6ef2-4056-bd83-2855b6dba1d0","title":"Chapter 48","date":"2026-05-18"},{"number":"47","chapter":"47","slug":"5d02d52c-9724-437c-811c-81ff19e87da3","title":"Chapter 47","date":"2026-05-10"},{"number":"46","chapter":"46","slug":"7d32a491-b1bf-4ddc-9e52-b95b1a1c55ad","title":"Chapter 46","date":"2026-05-03"},{"number":"45","chapter":"45","slug":"3c1b91b3-d7c0-41d7-97a6-18bc923b39e9","title":"Chapter 45","date":"2026-04-26"},{"number":"44","chapter":"44","slug":"4a425c8e-47ff-49e6-9cc6-04025ffa5109","title":"Chapter 44","date":"2026-04-19"},{"number":"43","chapter":"43","slug":"fd1f985a-76d3-488f-bd87-c1ad1ccf3c9c","title":"Chapter 43","date":"2026-04-12"},{"number":"42","chapter":"42","slug":"7829237d-f0fa-47bd-8935-7aefcfb54654","title":"Chapter 42","date":"2026-04-05"},{"number":"41","chapter":"41","slug":"39a06fa3-e81c-4439-9d4c-ad92933fd4e4","title":"Chapter 41","date":"2026-03-30"},{"number":"40","chapter":"40","slug":"34073507-074d-47aa-b617-04f74fcf60bf","title":"Chapter 40","date":"2026-03-23"},{"number":"39","chapter":"39","slu